Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: preserve firmware DSP mappings in generic EL2

Adapt Jens Glathe's T14s-tested fix to his integration tree; retain
qcom,broken-reset and the existing PAS-specific overlay.
Source: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20260914-x1-el2-unfuck-v1-1-00d8bc35a635@oldschoolsolutions.biz/

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1-el2.dtso
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1-el2.dtso
@@ -68,12 +68,10 @@
 };
 
 &remoteproc_adsp {
-	iommus = <&apps_smmu 0x1000 0x80>;
 	qcom,broken-reset;
 };
 
 &remoteproc_cdsp {
-	iommus = <&apps_smmu 0x0c00 0x0>;
 	qcom,broken-reset;
 };
 
